    {
      "id": "b0546f30-f6ee-49a4-bfa7-711a858d819e",
      "name": "Sticky Note ebc75c3f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -96,
        -304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 5 · design frame\nChecks its input, then asks `app.step5_frame` (SQL) for the frame the later steps build the grist inside: the rules and limits, one slot per wanted ingredient with its catalogue matches, the excluded and inventory words, the ingredient intents of the hints, and the attenuation the targets need. It holds no ratios. The output is checked against the step 5 contract. Writes nothing and calls no LLM: the pipeline logs it.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "486b8f89-b1a1-4eb3-98f7-6d266b5e5a47",
      "name": "Test data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Test data · editor run\nPin this on `When Executed by Another Workflow` (open the node, use the output panel's edit / mock-data control, paste the JSON, save), then click *Execute workflow*.\nWrites nothing (`run_id: 0` belongs to no run).\n\n```json\n[{\"run_id\": 0, \"brief\": {\"named\": \"West Coast IPA\", \"stated\": {\"batch_l\": 20, \"abv\": 6.5}, \"hints\": [\"bitter\"], \"wanted\": [], \"excluded\": [], \"inventory\": [], \"unknown\": [], \"guidance\": true}, \"profile\": {\"units\": \"metric\", \"water\": {\"ca\": 0.0, \"cl\": 0.0, \"mg\": 0.0, \"na\": 0.0, \"so4\": 0.0, \"hco3\": 0.0}, \"batch_l\": 20.0, \"losses_l\": 2.0, \"inventory\": [], \"boil_off_l_h\": 4.0, \"efficiency_pct\": 72.0, \"grain_abs_l_kg\": 1.0}, \"targets\": {\"knobs\": [{\"knob\": \"ibu\", \"hints\": \"bitter\", \"intent\": null, \"source\": \"unsourced\", \"direction\": 1}, {\"knob\": \"bu_gu\", \"hints\": \"bitter\", \"intent\": null, \"source\": \"bjcp-exam-study-guide-2017, p60\", \"direction\": 1}], \"style\": {\"code\": \"21A\", \"from\": \"chosen\", \"name\": \"American IPA\", \"because\": \"step 2 chose 21A\"}, \"mash_c\": {\"from\": \"midpoint\", \"value\": 66.5, \"because\": \"middle of rule 10's mash range 64–69 °C\"}, \"batch_l\": {\"from\": \"stated\", \"value\": 20, \"because\": \"stated by the user\"}, \"targets\": {\"fg\": {\"from\": \"midpoint\", \"value\": 1.011, \"because\": \"midpoint of 21A FG 1.008–1.014\"}, \"og\": {\"from\": \"derived\", \"value\": 1.0613, \"because\": \"solved so app.abv gives the stated ABV 6.5 at FG 1.011\"}, \"abv\": {\"from\": \"stated\", \"value\": 6.5, \"because\": \"stated by the user\"}, \"ibu\": {\"from\": \"hint\", \"value\": 66.25, \"because\": \"bitter: 87.5 % of 21A IBU 40–70\"}, \"srm\": {\"from\": \"midpoint\", \"value\": 10.0, \"because\": \"midpoint of 21A SRM 6–14\"}}, \"guidance\": true, \"conflicts\": []}}]\n```",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420
      }
    }
